r></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn2-cin-03-275"><p>M/H values: Staining intensity values represent gray scale levels between 0 (black) and 255 (white). In this study, Low/Negative values ranged between 132&#x02013;255, (0/1+), Moderate (M) values ranged between 118 and 131, whereas High (H) values ranged between 67&#x02013;112</p></fn><fn id="tfn3-cin-03-275"><p>P values: chi square test (Cl 99%)</p></fn><fn id="tfn4-cin-03-275"><p>EGFR IHC vs VEGF IHC: Kappa (Cl 95%) = 0.846</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>